OL,3,AFootage of Seoul crush to be removed
OL,4,Afrom Call of Duty after backlash
OL,5,
OL,6,FVideo clips showing the aftermath of a
OL,7,Fdeadly crush in Seoul will be removed
OL,8,Ffrom the latest Call of Duty game after
OL,9,Fan angry reaction from victims'
OL,10,Ffamilies.
OL,12,FReal life news coverage of the 2022
OL,13,Fdisaster which killed almost 160 people
OL,14,Fwas included in an opening scene of
OL,15,FModern Warfare 4 to illustrate a
OL,16,Ffictional invasion from North Korea.
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
FL,167,160,200,105,0,100
