OL,1,W5j 5Q7+j 55"k#j 5w;js1
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-.*,%-,* *,%%**,$ ,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AFootage of Seoul crush to be removed
OL,4,Afrom Call of Duty after backlash
OL,5,
OL,6,FBereaved families said they were
OL,7,F"appalled" to see the footage - which
OL,8,Fincluded people being removed on
OL,9,Fstretchers, body bags on the street and
OL,10,Fresuscitation efforts - repurposed for
OL,11,Fthe game.
OL,13,FActivision, which makes Call of Duty,
OL,14,Fhas since apologised and confirmed it
OL,15,Fwould be removed in the game's next
OL,16,Fupdate on 12 November.
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
